  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Embodied Books (2024), published by Peter Lang Verlag, has no recorded citations yet, but it is used in teaching.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Embodied Books by Darian Goldin Stahl was published by Peter Lang Verlag in 2024. It is part of the Medical Humanities: Criticism and Creativity series. Conceptually, the work connects to Embodied cognition, Computer science and Artificial intelligence.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">In teaching, it is listed in 1 open course syllabus and discussed in 1 recorded lecture. It is recorded in 2 library collections. Its subject matter aligns with Quality Education among the Sustainable Development Goals.</p>",
